  "limits": "Gathered 2026-11-07 for T-3483, Charles Nelson's standing livery. The coachman_1904 set shows coachmen on the box; this one shows a coachman on foot, full length, in the livery he stood in. Neither plate is of Chicago or of Nelson: a reference set says what a man of this role and decade looked like, not what Nelson wore. Both are monochrome halftones and say nothing about colour."
